`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `这是故事的终章，听到这首歌时，便能回忆起Sat的旅程。晚安，Saturday。`, `SELF`, `听到self就很感动！Sat已经走出姐姐去世的阴影了，但和Tuski时就像回忆起儿时的美好。姐姐的陪伴是如此温暖，杀我别用亲情刀。`, `STARGAZERS`, ``], [`wkahina`, `Angelstar / Dark Star`, `震撼`, `SELF`, `感动`, `SUPERNOVA`, ``, `STARGAZERS`, ``], [`选项怎么没有the river(`, `grode`, `grode.`, `Tutorial`, `同时填这首和solomon's seal会作废吗（`, `Solomon's Seal`, ``, `RAM (Rotating Auto-Mobiles)`, ``], [`7zy3t`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `两个字：真神`, `stop-motion`, `鼓先生的神作`, `Bloom in Two`, ``, `STARCRASHERS`, ``], [`UserB114`, `When the Dragon Falls`, `龙 币 陨 落 之 时十分震撼人心的日核，情感调动到位，眼前已经有巨龙的感觉了（大雾`, `UTF-8000000000`, `Attoclef咱会写能不能多写点😭😭😭初听没什么感觉，再听发现是纯冰，drop直接爽到天上去现已成为生活必需品`, `LORELEI`, ``, `Macropolis`, ``], [`求上W9教程`, `PYROMANIA`, `神曲，无需多言。作为萌新们第一次接触的魔王曲，初见这首歌给大家的震撼肯定不小。虽然说不是v/s原创，但是这首歌完全就是长在我的审美上：开头逐渐加快的节奏仿佛写出了Sat的救人心切，随后的一段疾走感很强，就如同Sat跑向火场一样，随后一段很硬的kick加入到了曲中，让人在打歌的时候体会到Sat在火场中的感觉，最后伴随着火燃烧的声音和消防车的警笛声，全曲结束。完美契合第一章结局`, `ULTiM∀TUM`, `就这个歌，爽！事实证明用荡作曲绘的都不是什么软柿子。整首曲子给我的感觉就是终末化的毁灭所带来的极致的爽感，全vs听的最爽的曲子，没有之一`, `stop-motion`, `鼓的最新（并非）力作，令人回味无穷，沉静中带着一丝狂暴。总之就是神曲，我懂得欣赏`, `SELF`, `看哭8266亿v/s玩家，曲子真神，情感调动飞上天了，每次打这个曲子都会掉小珍珠，可能也是我唯一一个AC之后也会去打一打的曲子了`], [`Max`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `想了很久还是选择这首，情感调动太强了我要听一辈子aefp`, `STARCRASHERS`, `哦对的对的，新年就该这样，反正就是很感人…good night.I love you.`, `stop-motion`, `神曲`, `SELF`, `……`], [`Motonic_queues`, `stop-motion`, `我说Frums是神`, `SELF`, `最伤感的一首，情感调动这一块`, `Bloom in Two`, ``, `STARGAZERS`, ``], [`spiral`, `SUPERNOVA`, `极致演出，充沛的情感，好歌，爱了`, `_ (placeholder, ch5 storyteller challenge)`, `震撼，`, `Wavetapper`, ``, `Random`, ``], [`Senior`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `不必多言`, `LORELEI`, `山茶花大作，无需再言(`, `SUPERNOVA`, ``, `Last Wish (vivid/stasis ver.)`, `This Is Your Last Wish`], [`clear`, `Shattered Sky After Rain`, `从雨中来 见雨过天晴 很喜欢的一首开幕曲`, `Bloom in Two`, `花开两朵`, ``, ``, ``, ``], [`READMEˆmd`, `STARGAZERS`, `我草太爽了兄弟谱太史了Cheryl你妈死了这么神的曲子写的像大粪`, `Crimson Dance (vivid/stasis Edit)`, `神曲比红死好听一万倍`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `请输入文本神曲，无需多言`, `Bloom in Two`, `碎核我喜欢你诶我草掺冰了这么好听`], [`Cyrogen`, `Fixations Toward the Stars`, `神曲，因为这首入坑vs`, `valor/starcross`, `豪庭`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `剧情太好了`, `STARGAZERS`, `阵容最豪华的一集`], [`theSOYPR`, `CONVERGENCE`, `丰富的人声采样，尤其是过于“凄厉”的高频，产生了极为独特的听感，使之成为我听过的最爽核曲之一。在CONVERGENCE的渲染之下，即便是仿佛是软弱的象征一样的Allison，为了保护所爱之人也能表现出如此磅礴的愤怒。“亲爱的我来救你了！”`, `stop-motion`, `国庆自驾游的时候被日推这首歌，然后就入坑vivid/stasis了。究竟要怎样才能用语言描述Frums的声音😭`, `thrinos;pygmalion`, ``, `Arachnid`, ``], [`Enderson`, `ASTELLION`, `Lost in the labyrinth of your own heart, can you still hear the song of the cosmos?劲疾的速核鼓点，neotrance独特的失谐音色，如狂风呼啸般凛冽的密集琶音，冰冷的amen break，共同构成了全曲压迫感十足的氛围，也凸显着其间旋律的昂扬和宿命感，作为final landing的收官曲可谓恰如其分。作为一首多曲风融合的作品，Type R可以说是很好地平衡了各种元素：在1st drop处速核kickroll提供冲击力的同时穿插的acid音色增添了爽感；在build up和完整版的休息段，neotrance特有的大失谐supersaw拓宽了景深，让意境更加宏大；尾杀之后的dnb+acid更是刷新了听感，令人眼前一亮。——于是，一个奇迹，即将在这无止境的循环中到来。`, `Crimson Dance (vivid/stasis Edit)`, `神作，无须多言。抛开糟糕的混音不谈（），曲子很好地体现了那种躁郁之间微妙的哀伤意境。在恬静的歌词之间粗暴地插入暴躁的嘶吼，正如Saturday在她自我解放的旅途中一次次的自我怀疑和挣扎；采样的运用也十分有个人特色，在顾及律动的同时把那种混乱的躁狂感体现得淋漓尽致。相比完整版，游戏内收录的版本结构更加清晰，前半段着重表现“躁狂”，后半段着重表现“抑郁”。个人认为后半段才是精髓，随着失真的人声的吟唱，原本平息的鼓点再次归于躁动，但在这之上的旋律却显得无比温柔而克制，一急一缓间能听出忧郁中重燃的希望，情感饱满，张力拉满。当然，对Saturday而言，这首歌曲所展现的，绝对不是故事的结局，而是她在彻底摆脱创伤前的最后一次回眸。在前方等待着她的，将是一个光明的未来。`, `Shattered Sky After Rain`, `这首曲子最戳我的一点是对那种夏日雨后清新而朦胧的神韵的把握。作者没有用音色的堆砌来渲染氛围，只用空阔的混响和如雨丝一般滑落的清脆钢琴填补段落空缺，简单的编排反倒让意境多了几分空灵。lead音色的设计也十分巧妙，朦胧中又略带俏皮，如同少女羞涩的笑颜。`, `heptagramme`, `两位制作人能把常人难以驾驭的七拍子写得如此趣味盎然，实在令人惊叹。从律动的安排上来看，本曲完全没有照搬四四拍的写作思路，而是巧妙地运用基于三拍子的套拍把节奏简化，保留七拍子的实验性的同时也照顾了听众的听感，做到了让律动“奇”而不“怪”，足以看出编排上的巧思。而本曲的出彩之处远不止于律动，从张弛有度的bassline到恰如其分的ear candy点缀，再到淡雅自然而捉摸不定的旋律线，处处透着优雅的气质，配合着纯净朴素的音色设计，在听众心中留下淡而有味的印象。`], [`藤昼前海`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `只有经历一路艰难的解密、跑图与魔王曲挑战，才能体会到这首曲子的恢宏、震撼与戏终的落寞之处。从最初的钢琴代入奠定主旋律，多重风格的炫技，之前所有魔王曲的混合串烧，最终Saturday与Dawn决战时刻的超长尾杀，最后回到钢琴的缓缓收尾；这首歌给每一位玩到主线最后的vs玩家上演了最精彩的一场戏的落幕，让每个人久久停滞，回味无穷。我想如果vs没有创作出这首曲子，那么vs可能就真的会成为一款有着不少优质独占曲的冷门佳作音游，被无数玩家——包括我自己——落在steam里面进而被时间所埋没吧。但是acta est fabula,plaudite这首曲子的出现将这个游戏带到了一个其他音游难以企及的高度。纵观迄今为止所有的音游，绝大多数制作人出于各种各样的考量更愿意去将音游曲与剧情分隔开来，但是vivid/stasis却创作出了这样一首将音乐、铺面与剧情完美相结合的长音游曲，对我来讲这是一种极具艺术性的行为。我一直认为音乐是一种载体，一首好的音乐能承载着作者（作品）的经历与情感，而acta est fabula,plaudite毫无疑问做到了这一点。14min的长音乐时间为之表现了极强的叙事性，多种多样的音乐风格则提供了情感表达的可能。串烧部分将之前风格迥异的魔王曲非常富有技术力地混合在了一起，让从最初走到终章的玩家再次回味起这一路的奇幻、美好与艰难并为之动容。决战部分的尾杀与超长drop让积攒起来的情绪彻底爆发，沉寂之后由钢琴收尾，收述主线。整体听下来令人叹为观止。也许总有人会认为这首歌过誉了。但是对我而言，是aefp让我入坑vs，并与Saturday一同见证了这一奇幻，美好和无比赞叹的旅途；毫无疑问，这就是我听过的最惊艳的音游曲。即便在变幻莫测的未来，当我回想以前的美好经历时——不仅是对往事的回首，也是自己人生阶段的落幕——我相信我也都会想起Vivid/Stasis，还有这首意义重大的曲子，即是：acta est fabula,plaudite`, `Angelstar / Dark Star`, `作为游戏剧情的最终曲，vs居然把两首歌拼接到了一起，很大程度上弥补了听Angelstar没听爽的空白（）尽管有的地方听起来相当的糊和炸，但是配合铺面的模糊炫彩异象真的是能将人拉入最后告别的那一抹神秘与感伤之中。毫无疑问是很优秀的告别曲。'It's OK.The shining future will always waiting for you.'`, `CONVERGENCE`, `三人合作的超爽魔王曲，结尾的高音电吉他音色结合剧情里Allison把大剑反击dawn真的爽飞了好吗But taking the journey with those I love... that's what I'll live for！ That's what I choose！`, `Reboot`, `这应该是vs给人带来的听感最神奇的一首之一了。整体的音色之间比较碎但很和谐，特殊的人声处理方式也让人欲罢不能，2m06s那里进入后不断的连续从整到散三拍子旋律和重音相得益彰，是个人非常喜欢的一段，整体听起来真的非常非常非常的冰。如果结尾段再丰富一点想必会有更多人喜欢这首歌。`], [`季冬忘葭`, `χΩ`, `疾走的感觉很对我胃口`, `∀`, `好听`, `STARCRASHERS`, ``, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, ``], [`Rases`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `伟大，无需多言。`, `The Last Page`, `从4k入坑到vs探图遇到这首歌的感动。`, `execution_program`, ``, `SUPERNOVA`, ``], [`Nin1GOOD`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `“Good Night！”`, `χΩ`, `帅`, `SUPERNOVA`, `爽`, `stop-motion`, `牛逼`], [`B3611V`, `B3611V`, `B3611V！我的最爱❤️！碎核里永远的神！`, `B3611V`, `B3611V！我的最爱❤️！碎核里永远的神！`, `B3611V`, `B3611V！我的最爱❤️！碎核里永远的神！`, `3.1V.C1`, `蒜鸟蒜鸟，随后一票留给我“兄弟”好了`], [`iceclr1`, `CLAUDIA -libertia-`, `从开头的钟声起，这首魔王曲就在不停地展现那个8266次循环中荒芜、虚无又狂暴的世界。虽然其他部分也很好听，不过我个人最喜欢的是00:00-00:24的intro和01:23-01：42的build up，逐渐积累的蓄势感比高潮更能体现Dawn的暴怒。`, `thrinos;pygmalion`, `太令人舒适了！l'avenir proche总是能写出这么美妙的color bass，从00:17就开始的bass炫技段如同被人猛击一般，给人以不一样的惊奇的快感。`, `SENT://INEL`, `个人认为是Kry.exe在v/s里收录的几首中最好听的，尤其是最后速核drop的旋律非常有味道，能把情绪推上去，衔接上的问题也改善了很多。`, `ULTiM∀TUM`, `完全爽曲，没有一段是多余的，要论能让人嗨起来的程度，这首无疑是整个终章最高的山，最长的河。最惊艳的部分莫过于02:27在情绪已经很高涨的情况下，竟然还能一转uptempo把暴力程度再往上推一级。中间break的旋律也不错。`], [`XINHDE`, `SUPERNOVA`, `I don't know what to say.`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `.`, `Last Wish (vivid/stasis ver.)`, ``, ``, ``], [`Niney`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `神曲后面忘了`, `CONVERGENCE`, `神曲后面又忘了`, `CLAUDIA -libertia-`, ``, `ULTiM∀TUM`, ``], [`kanorasan`, `Angelstar`, `星暗示？星暗示？星暗示？星暗示？星暗示？星暗示？星暗示？`, `There`, `there are two things three or four~`, `heptagramme`, `四七拍，神`, `:3c`, `:3c`], [`XY_world`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `111`, `(execute.)`, `我说牙刷🪥的伟大无需多言作为vs最具有特色的配置全端独一份的🪥配置execute.真的是世纪最神谱面`, `Unraveling Stasis`, ``, `SENT://INEL`, ``], [`QIPFM77`, `Luminous Entities Lost Heart`, `Luminous Entities Lost Heart以极具情感感染力的音色、编排以及情绪饱满的人声排在了我所认为的Top 1，无论是开头、drop极具冲击力的bass还是结尾颇有设计挂满ott的钢琴（特别是卡顿设计），都把整首歌的情绪渲染层次分明、鲜活生动，给予人一涌而入的感动情绪，同时独具特色的节奏给音游谱面的创作提供了发挥空间，也在玩家的游玩体验中添入了不寻常的震撼感。`, `Synthesis.`, `喜欢`, `First Breath`, ``, `Synthesis.`, ``], [`Sue`, `SELF`, `神曲，我懂得欣赏`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `神曲，我懂得欣赏`, `SUPERNOVA`, ``, `Luminous Entities Lost Heart`, ``], [`ryanchen`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `14分钟，不仅是游戏最长曲目，更是最终曲目，背景特效和美术也超好！`, `APOCALYPSE CALL`, `好。（暗启示？）`, `grode`, `《最强改编曲》`, `Scarlet Death`, `喜欢，但解不动`], [`Chill`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `究极马拉松神曲，在众多音游魔王曲中绝对算的上T0`, `SENT://INEL`, `原版真爽飞了`, `Goodbye To Your Vicious Cycles`, `为什么我这么晚才知道这首歌😢`, `APOCALYPSE CALL`, ``], [`琉璃梦`, `MULTIPHEX`, `太顶了，听感很新奇，越听越喜欢`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `戏终，掌声起，完美的落幕`, `SUPERNOVA`, `下巴掉下来`, `Crimson Dance (vivid/stasis Edit)`, `还是喜欢原版，很有vs的感觉`], [`toforgeteasy`, `Unraveling Stasis`, `It's Unraveling Stasis. What's not to love about Unraveling Stasis? It's *the* song of all time for me.`, `χΩ`, ``, `Surtr's Wish`, ``, `Scarlet Death`, ``], [`vipnice`, `Yamai`, `this song KICKS ASS`, `Unraveling Stasis`, `very cool synth and drum combos its very silly and i like it a lot`, `Wavetapper`, `frums my goatwavetapper is a very cool experiment on how adding rhythms affects a song and it sounds great`, `MVURBD`, `CUMMING`], [`mistofjudgment`, `_ (placeholder, ch5 storyteller challenge)`, `I was hooked on V/S since seeing that chapter 1 lock but this chart cemented this game as one my personal favorites.`, `Bloom in Two`, `I listen to this song so much when im just going about my day. It just has such a relaxed vibe when compared to a lot of the other songs.`, `:3c`, `:3`, `septima`, `This one is just really fun for me to play. I love seeing it pop up in soundscan.`], [`alli_tgshm`, `Bloom in Two`, `10/10 would put on my wallpaper again`, `STARCRASHERS`, `very tear inducing :alli_weh:`, `SELF`, `very tear inducing`, `χΩ`, `the unknown may be absolute`], [`Isloo`, `SUPERNOVA`, `My beloved….`, `_ (placeholder, ch5 storyteller challenge)`, ``, `stop-motion`, ``, `SELF`, ``], [`aquaticstarr`, `Crosshatch`, `One of my favorite tracks, not to mention (imo) very overrated (difficulty wise) on the opening and middle.I love the 8-bit style. It's like it's calm but also intense at the same time and I like that especially with a super difficult finale. and also I like the charting style. Did you know Crosshatch Finale is the hardest song in the game with Chord as its highest skillset? And Crosshatch Middle is the third hardest in that regard. I want more charts like that!Crosshatch Opening is also my only VS in the game - not the easiest, but I just like the song a lot :3`, `Macropolis`, `MACROPOLIS ENCORE WHENthis is probably the most popular of my votes if i had to guess`, `3, 2, 1, Let's Go`, `i enjoy this genre a lot. one day i will  beat the finale with charge. one day.`, `Faux Real (VIVID REDUX)`, `i Guarantee you no one else voted thisI love this one,, I'd love it even more if I could get an S ! ! ! :3similarly to crosshatch (but obviously for a different reason) i like how its calm but also intense and it feels so cool playing its tough finale given that`], [`Stella`, `DeSPAROLA`, `good song am skill issued`, `First Breath`, ``, ``, ``, ``, ``], [`Hazel`, `SUPERNOVA`, `Kind of an obvious choice but this song is timeless, it's on that level where I just never get sick of it, it could be five times as long and I'd still listen to it.In context too SUPERNOVA is an accurate representation of that point in the story which is often the one where newcomers know they'll stick with the game afterwards, there's just nothing like it.`, `STARGAZERS`, `You can't not get hyped listening to this and it's a great fit for the type of mods it has (sorry middle diff players)`, `safe_state (MANIAQ Sound Team Remix)`, `Not an original but it's such a nice sound that doesn't get listened to enough, listen to shelter while you're at it`, `execution_program`, `It was this song that started to get me to look at the game as something really special, I've never heard anything as powerful as this and since then it's been my benchmark of songs as abstract storytelling`], [`win`, `:3c`, `ALL IN ON TIEBREAKERS!!!! (this is so funky with polyrhythms i cant believe i sightread this well)`, `When the Dragon Falls`, `this is too much of a banger what the fuckkkk`, `evil pimp dracula fire beat`, `look who WOULDN'T vote for the funny shitpost and imagine dracula from evil pimp dracula fire beat doing some SICK MOVES????`, `ENERGY SYNERGY MATRIX`, `esm pow! self explanatory`], [`Lexa`, `First Breath`, `It's the coolest thing ever`, `Crimson Dance (vivid/stasis Edit)`, `More balanced charts are always a fun time`, `STARCRASHERS`, `I cried`, `crack in the earth`, `Represents a banger tone shift in the story love to see it`], [`mauve `, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `Plaudite `, `SUPERNOVA`, `It’s good `, `CLAUDIA -libertia-`, `CLAUDIA`, `stop-motion`, ``], [`umi`, `First Breath`, `First boss song I did unspoiled and kry.exe was already my fav artist in the game, so it hit hard.`, `stop-motion`, `frums name drop Cinema`, `Random`, `instant flow state `, `+ERABY+E CONNEC+10N`, `song that made me wanna get good`], [`Lopolys`, `Fixations Toward the Stars`, `I think that's the song that really caught me in the game. There are many that had quite the same effect but Fixations Toward the Stars is clearly the song that made me really start playing the game and also made me discover Foodbot, which is now one of my favorite artist to listen to. It's thanks to this song that I really decided to improve at this game and rhythm game overall, and then allowed me to fell into the story of the game, which is so great. The song also fits very well with it's title imo and it slaps.`, `SELF`, `SELF is such a beautiful song, both in the story and musically. It really is a healing music for heavy hearts, bringing joy when listened to. It's also a really memorable moment in the game with the background reflecting the advance of the merge of Saturday and Tsuki, but in a way that looks way more natural than the one happening for Storyteller during stop-motion (even if it's quite logic to be fair)`, `Bloom in Two`, `This song surprised me when I first listened to it since i didn't expect such chill music as a boss song. And I love it. The fact that it represents Allison is also a plus for me but the song is soooooo pretty ! I don't know what more to say since i have nothing else in mind than it's such a pretty song, I love it. It has a different effect than SELF since Bloom in Two kinda leaves me in awe before such beauty.  Bloom in Two also feels like a ray of light creating a calm area by going through the energetic and darker sounds of the three other songs of the Unity Nexus bosses.`, `_ (placeholder, ch5 storyteller challenge)`, `_, Dual, placeholder or whatever it is called, is such an underrated song. Even I sometimes forget it exists but when i remember it, I always think It's so great, it must be at least top 5 music in the entire game. And it's not 5th. I don't play it that much ig since it's located in the Boundary Shatter, and it also makes it more forgetable since not common to play. But when you (re)start playing the chart (again), it is so unique and memorable with his mods making you feel the fear and pain of the song. Plus, when put back in the original context of when you first play it in the story, it fits so well with the fighting the trauma of Tsuki's death and feels as hard as facing the trauma ourselves (at least for the first time since nobody CAN be ready for THAT)`], [`alejandra`, `Angelstar`, `i have a super lexycat bias, i actually knew of dark blossom and listened to the whole album (and also all songs that were available at the time (some have been taken down since)) long before any of lexycat's work was added to v/s. this isn't my favorite from that album (i pick moonscythe, dark blossom, werewolf and 花火) but its still pretty cool tbqh`, `grode`, `the song turned into a meme but its actually pretty good i like it`, `Crimson Dance (vivid/stasis Edit)`, `same reason as Angelstar. this one actually has elements of the next song, &sleep, inside`, `CLAUDIA -libertia-`, `the piano ostinato at the beginning is what got me to check out this song and i did NOT regret it`], [`rainshruum`, `Locked Out`, `has a lot of deep meaning to me due to hearing it so much during a certain period of my life`, `_ (placeholder, ch5 storyteller challenge)`, ``, `ASTELLION`, ``, `stop-motion`, ``], [`Infinity6000`, `PYROMANIA`, `🔥`, `STARGAZERS`, ``, `Yamai`, ``, `Is This It Is It`, ``], [`NKshukketsu`, `Bloom in Two`, `Best ending to any song I've played in a rhythm game.`, `G e n g a o z o`, ``, `SELF`, ``, `Credits`, ``], [`BaBa`, `stop-motion`, `It scratches my brain just right`, `SUPERNOVA`, `So violent with very satisfying bpm changes`, `First Breath`, `It goes so hard and is so violent`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `It makes my brain go vroom vroom as I listen and take in all the references to the other boss songs`], [`Rases`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `No doubt.`, `SUPERNOVA`, `No doubt.`, `STARCRASHERS`, `No doubt.`, `SELF`, `No doubt.`], [`oats`, `Bloom in Two`, `believe it or not this song has helped me find myself`, `MULTIPHEX`, `banger!!!`, `stop-motion`, `made me find v/s`, `SUPERNOVA`, `i mean how could i not vote for supernova`], [`Anna`, `stop-motion`, `Awesome moment in the story + a very fun chart`, `G e n g a o z o`, ``, `SELF`, ``, `Yamai`, ``], [`Selne`, `DeSPAROLA`, `DeSPAROLA is what cemented my love for this game`, `Revelation`, `This song is soooo good`, `MVURBD`, ``, `Rrhar'il`, ``], [`Cromonic`, `stardust`, `i just love this song and its chart so so so much its like doodle so :3-coded`, `STARGAZERS`, `peak too`, `SELF`, `so emotionally impactful, and such a good song too`, `SENT://INEL`, `the 123412341234 part in middle is sooooo satisfying`], [`eyeracc`, `CONVERGENCE`, `I really love the build up before the song even plays, solving ungodly amount of puzzles in the ch5 escape room while having to play the other songs from the previous locks before being able to open the final door really builds up and makes it all the more exciting when you listen to it. Not to mention the music box version that plays during the dialogue before. It makes listening to the song feel more special and such a great experience.`, `SUPERNOVA`, `The song itself is actually one of the main reasons I played vivid/stasis. I listened to it first before playing the game and even knowing that it exists. I really love the ending of the song and the way it reflects onto the fight between Tsuki and Dawn.`, `SELF`, `I can't stop listening to this song. The dialogue exchange between Tsuki and Saturday before they merge really reflects onto this song. This song radiates happiness and the acceptance of Saturday as this is the last time she would ever see her sister. In the middle of the song, Saturday pauses the merge to give her last message to Tsuki before the song resumes and ends. To me, this song contrasts so well with the song right after which is acta est fabula, plaudite and the fight with Dawn.`, `STARCRASHERS`, `Experiencing STARCRASHERS especially right after unlocking and playing STARGAZERS as I started playing around new year's was such an amazing experience. This song feels like a love letter to the game from all the artists who contributed original songs to the game. I wish I had played sooner honestly so I could experience the song itself during new year's.`], [`Anaya`, `stop-motion`, `One of the most powerful moments in the game (also I love Frums)`, `UTF-8000000000`, `EVERYTHING I EVER TOLD YOU IS A LIEEE`, `3.1V.C1`, `my left hand T_TAlso really fun to play`, `Signals Afar`, `Most friendly for newcomers`], [`Lucy`, `There`, `I just fuck with garlagan so heavy its crazy`, `the more i carry on...`, `i like the production and instrument switches`, `even at the end of the world, you left it`, `cool song`, `Is This It Is It`, `so impactful after the credits`], [`Madeline_044`, `SUPERNOVA`, `The song is made in a way that represents the feeling of battle, starting off easy but with strikes of will in between, both in the situation and in the song. It is really well made and it's always so good to listen to. It feels like a fight-or-flight situation where sometimes it's slow and near the end it's gonna be the *end* pretty much. The first time it caught me off guard with that and it never fails to make me feel the whole situation`, `STARGAZERS`, `Usually im not a fan of songs like this, it started off slow too, but then it stroke me: it wasn't a normal song like anything I've heard before, this held a meaning no other songs could've conveyedThe fact that all of the team worked on this adds even more meaning to this because of how teamwork can make godly things nobody expects, and that's what it feels like from the song too! This would've been a loved vote too if it wasn't for the fact that it's my usual style, but still love it`, `Bloom in Two`, `This songs is a constant burst of unexpected behavior. I don't really know the meaning behind it, but the fact that it's so disorganized makes me feel that one of Sat's last challenge was to get beyond all of the casualties that could've happened in there and everything that happened before. Aside from that, this song is a banger lmao`, `MARENOL`, `Okay so MARENOL is the feeling of dying multiple times in a fever dream/nightmare until you die in real life, caused by depression and what would be a medicine. Why does this matter? The screams, the heart beating, the speeding up and slowing down casually, the clock ticking, they all mean something to the one living this situation and to us when we feel like everywhere we go is not right. This entropy-like feeling when we don't know what's happening and why but it still feels like you're dying inside. I love songs that convey such a deep and profound meaning. I would like to say that overall, all of these songs would be my favorite (loved vote) because, although so different, they share lots of emotions and feelings that can be felt by people in the real world too. Thanks Hajimeli Team <3`], [`frosblaze`, `acta est fabula, plaudite`, `14 minutes of pure peak (i also love how it references other songs)`, `Nhelv`, `i like the drop at the end`, `stop-motion`, `probably one of the best song representations in the game. also just a very good song in general`, `Synthesis.`, `my first introduction to tn-shi, and i just really like it (the ai art in the original video is a little disappointing though)`], [`Vinnie`, `SUPERNOVA`, `The guitar solo carries I can ' t even lie`, `Bloom in Two`, `the ending is so beautiful.`, `Crimson Dance (vivid/stasis Edit)`, `A really fun song to play and listen to! And awesome title screen song`, `the more i carry on...`, `I dont know how to explain it but the beat drop is so so cool !`], [`coffeeflake`, `00`, `when i just found a banger in the shop, after playing learnt There's backstage as wellty taro for the backstage`, `NULCTRL`, `this because there's no NULCTRL EXENC NULCTRL somehow harder than NULCTRL EX by ten fold`, `+ERABY+E CONNEC+10N`, `jacks still haunt me in dreams (again shattered is easier than backstage)`, `grode`, `grode`], [`Lukas`, `Bloom in Two`, `I personally love Allison, but most of all I love the song itself, tailspun is masterful at making this kind of song, and it shows. The meaning behind it is also very pretty, and I just really enjoyed this song the most out of any in the Final Chapter. Which is surprising considering the sheer quality of the tracklist there.`, `Angelstar / Dark Star`, `Absolutely insane. When I got to play Angelstar for the first time I was in awe looking at my screen and listening to that banger, but when I unlocked its full version I was extatic.`, `STARGAZERS`, `Meaning behind it made me cry the first time around.Will never forget when I played this song for the first time, and then read episode 25.`, `Scarlet Death`, `For this it was merely the shock factor. I didn't even know this song existed before stumbling upon it. I was so insanely shocked to see that I had missed this completely, and I could experience it for the first time, without any spoilers nor expectations...That fricking level 16 fakeout was insane, and I remember screaming at it.So good.Also the chart is insane, the challenge is utterly difficult and I still don't know how I beat it, and the song is FANTASTIC.`], [`43`, `thrinos;pygmalion`, `asdf,,,,`, `heptagramme`, `l'avenir proche.....`, `:3c`, `:3c`, `SUPERNOVA`, `it's just.. so.....  ,,,,,`]]

const RESULT: {
  name: string
  most: number
  normal: number
  total: number
  comments: [string, string, boolean][]
}[] = []

for (let i = 0; i < data.length; i++) {
  const [username = "", v1 = "", c1 = "", v2 = "", c2 = "", v3 = "", c3 = "", v4 = "", c4 = ""] = data[i] as string[]

  const MOST = 3
  const v1_res = RESULT.find(x => x.name == v1)
  if (v1_res) {
    v1_res.most += 1
    v1_res.total += MOST
    v1_res.comments.push([username, c1, true])
  } else if(v1) {
    RESULT.push({
      name: v1,
      most: 1,
      normal: 0,
      total: MOST,
      comments: [[username, c1, true]]
    })
  }

  const v2_res = RESULT.find(x => x.name == v2)
  if (v2_res && v2 && v1 != v2) {
    v2_res.normal += 1
    v2_res.total += 1
    v2_res.comments.push([username, c2, false])
  }
  if (!v2_res && v2) {
    RESULT.push({
      name: v2,
      most: 0,
      normal: 1,
      total: 1,
      comments: [[username, c2, false]]
    })
  }
  const v3_res = RESULT.find(x => x.name == v3)
  if (v3_res && v3 && ![v1, v2].includes(v3)) {
    v3_res.normal += 1
    v3_res.total += 1
    v3_res.comments.push([username, c3, false])
  } else if (!v3_res) {
    RESULT.push({
      name: v3,
      most: 0,
      normal: 1,
      total: 1,
      comments: [[username, c3, false]]
    })
  }
  const v4_res = RESULT.find(x => x.name == v4)
  if (v4_res && v4 && ![v1, v2, v3].includes(v4)) {
    v4_res.normal += 1
    v4_res.total += 1
    v4_res.comments.push([username, c4, false])
  } else if (!v4_res) {
    RESULT.push({
      name: v4,
      most: 0,
      normal: 1,
      total: 1,
      comments: [[username, c4, false]]
    })
  }
}

import {computed, nextTick, ref, useTemplateRef} from "vue"

RESULT.splice(RESULT.findIndex(x => x.name == "" || x.name == ""), 1)
RESULT.splice(RESULT.findIndex(x => x.name == "" || x.name == ""), 1)
const res = ref(RESULT.slice())

res.value.sort((a, b) => b.total - a.total)


const ix = ref("acta est fabula, plaudite")
const the = computed(() => {
  return RESULT.find(x => x.name == ix.value)
})

const the_ref = useTemplateRef<HTMLDivElement>("the-ref")
function set_ix(x: string) {
  ix.value = x
  nextTick(() => {
    the_ref.value?.scrollTo({top: 0})
  })
}
</script>

